sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as UI Component (QuickAddExpense)
    participant App as App State (App.tsx)
    participant Store as Storage Module (expenseStorage)
    participant LS as Browser localStorage

    U->>UI: Enter expense details & submit
    UI->>App: onAddExpense(newExpense)
    App->>Store: saveExpenses([...expenses, newExpense])
    Store->>LS: Write updated expenses
    Store-->>App: Confirm save
    App->>UI: Update expense list
    UI->>U: Show updated expenses
